        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steven Earl \"Steve\" Gaines\n- Organizations: Lynyrd Skynyrd\n- Products: Street Survivors, \"That Smell\"\n- Topics: Southern rock\n\nFacts:\n- In May 1976, Steven Earl \"Steve\" Gaines became a member of Lynyrd Skynyrd, an American Southern rock band.\n- In 1977, the song \"That Smell\" was released on the LP Street Survivors.\n- Steven Earl \"Steve\" Gaines was the guitarist who played on the LP Street Survivors.\n- Steven Earl \"Steve\" Gaines remained a member of Lynyrd Skynyrd until his death in October 1977.",
